§9 A guide for making a        house a home!
#- §9   ⛏*⋆§1Article Two§9⋆*⛏
     §4ᴰᵒⁿ'ᵗ ᴸᵒˢᵉ ʸᵒᵘʳ ᴴᵉᵃᵈ
§8-------------------
§1Craftadia has this tiny little fellow who hangs around in the main shopping area. He is often seen holding a block of grass above his head. I know he does this because I told him about my Endermen pest control issue, but he
#- §1found it funny and now mocks me. Anyway, he sells decorative heads for moonstones as a head merchant. 

Not…actual…heads, I don’t know why he calls them that, it’s not like he runs around decapitating people…right?!

                    (⊙＿⊙') 
#- §1These blocks can be super useful in your builds because let’s face facts; smaller versions of things that already exist are cute and collectable. As I mentioned last time, this provides another way of adding extra detail and realism. My personal favourites are small animals, food items, 
#- §1barrels, pots, clocks, books and skulls. Plonk one anywhere and your home becomes instantly more interesting. You can also wear them on your head and become an inanimate object for a day if you wish, so that’s a bonus....

