      §8/warp zodiac
§6└───   §c⋆⋅☆⋅⋆   §6───┘
§cNow this one is right up my street! Do you love astrology as a good witch should? Do you read the horoscope page in this magazine? Then /warp zodiac is for you! It is small and adorable. But the fantastic building
#- §cskills and interior design this person has to offer are just the tip of the iceberg. It’s the glorious map art that steals the show. How any map art is made is beyond my brain capacity and patience, yet here you can find beautifully made zodiac art. Now it’s important to point out that these are
#- §conly available in the §6YELLOW §cworld so far, which is sad for me, a witch, who loves these, who would spend good money on these, who lives in §2GREEN §c(please do §2green§c)..... §2green§c....

Anyway, the work and creativity behind this are mind-blowing and rather magical. Not all zodiacs have been
#- §cmade yet but progress certainly has. I can see the people of craftadia showing off their signs proudly, and I can’t wait to see the whole set…


§6┌───   §c⋆⋅☆⋅⋆   §6───┐
    §8I give this warp:
      §6★★★★★ 5.0
